1]Explain Object class in java ?

	->Object is an inbuilt class in java which is coming from java.lang package
	->Object class is the parent class for all the classes in java
	->In Object class thier are 8 important built in methods
		i)equals()
		ii)hashCode()
		iii)toString()
		iv)clone()
		v)finalize()
		vi)wait()
		vii)notify()
		viii)notifyAll()
		
2]Explain equals and hashcode contract ?

	->When 2 objects are equal then they should have equal hashcode
	->When 2 hashcodes are equal then they need not be equal objects
	